# Pairs with OwnSagaCommitNeedsDurableDecision. The persisted decision is not
# consulted, so an own-saga commit cuts over a saga a peer may still abort.
MODULE: PeerRestoreCommitsUndecidedOwnSaga
TARGET: OwnSagaCommitNeedsDurableDecision
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a commit naming this cluster's own saga runs although its coordinator has not decided to commit
PERTURBS: Commit

--- FIND
ELSE IF read # "commit" THEN "refused"
--- REPLACE
ELSE IF FALSE THEN "refused"
--- END
